n\n<img width=\"2688\" height=\"925\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e669e2d-12b7-4708-9712-13661b0dafee\" />\n\n2. Click on the pencil icon to edit the BlendSpace1D\n\n\n<img width=\"2736\" height=\"1012\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/347065f7-283c-4a33-a9f8-47579a846c2d\" />\n\n3. Type something into the Blend Position and you'll notice that the BlendSpace1D UI does not change unless you click into it manually.\n\n<img width=\"534\" height=\"1033\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07ad2cf7-8391-45a7-a54e-7c233fe33925\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112252/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}